        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[clamp(24px,3.5vw,32px)] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink mb-2">How to brief creators for UGC ads</h2>
        <div class="tldr">
          <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 space-y-1">
