          { q: "What are UGC ads?", a: "UGC ads are paid advertisements that use creator-made video as the ad creative. A real person films content about a product — a testimonial, a demo, an unboxing — and the brand runs that video as a paid ad on Meta, TikTok, or YouTube. They outperform brand-produced ads because they look native, not like ads." },
